| `launcher.long_scripts.<name>.cpus` | integer | `make verify`, `make test` and `make canary` get `8` | a launch key (the command as the decision line prints it) mapped to a whole number, 1 or more | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`) | Lists the launch key as long whatever its record says, and sets the cpus a farm submission asks for it. | a script that must never go to a farm: `launcher.local_only` | always |
